1
00:00:00,004 --> 00:00:01,443
My grandpa loves to grow flowers
我爷爷喜欢种花

2
00:00:01,443 --> 00:00:03,722
He has a big garden full of colorful flowers
他有一个开满五颜六色花朵的大花园

3
00:00:03,722 --> 00:00:04,283
Every morning
每天早晨

4
00:00:04,283 --> 00:00:06,094
he waters the plants and talks to them
他给植物浇水并与它们交谈

5
00:00:06,123 --> 00:00:08,335
Grandpa knows all the names of the flowers
爷爷知道所有花的名字

6
00:00:08,523 --> 00:00:10,855
He teaches me how to take care of the plants
他教我如何照顾植物

7
00:00:10,923 --> 00:00:12,855
We spend a lot of time together in the garden
我们花了很多时间在花园里

8
00:00:13,083 --> 00:00:15,122
The flowers make our garden very beautiful
这些花使我们的花园非常漂亮

9
00:00:15,124 --> 00:00:17,535
Grandpa's favorite flower is the rose
爷爷最喜欢的花是玫瑰花

10
00:00:17,643 --> 00:00:19,375
I Love helping him in the garden
我喜欢在花园里帮他

11
00:00:19,484 --> 00:00:20,855
and learning about flowers
学习花

